      <!-- DllRunner only needs src for CryptoApiDllLoader.h/CryptoApi.h's own type declarations
           (CCryptoApi, ErrorCode, ProviderKind, etc.); unlike AppBuilder/DllBuilder/LibBuilder it
           does not compile the crypto engine itself, so it needs none of their 3rdParty include
